[{"client_msg_id":"581a928d-b78b-4ac3-9f90-edc00174a998","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"バターっぽさは感じなかったので、これはバターを使わないタイプなのかも。\n小学校の給食を家に持ち帰って食べた時の味を思い出しました（乾燥したパン）。","ts":"1637756525.337100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RC9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdf47658-8197-4c3a-afc0-386d131fb3a8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"酒盗連みたいなつまみセットがあったりしたらアレだな、と思った。","ts":"1637756376.335600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vzERM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19911cea-599b-4cb9-9c1e-4c1d30a29144","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、ちがった","ts":"1637756240.335100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CabT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"039a6a77-afb2-46cc-ad08-be044ebfd594","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"バターに付けて、馴染ませるんじゃかなったっけ? \u0026gt; シュトーレン","ts":"1637756174.334900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/57+9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e227150-bb70-4293-a6b7-7458a9c21b37","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"シュトーレンを初めて買ってみましたが、乾いたパンにいろいろ詰めて砂糖でコーティングした食べ物という感想だったので、もう買ってまで食べなくてもいいなという学びがありました。","ts":"1637755649.334400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e6q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3CB0E2F0-210A-43D4-B4DD-F7B64935B9B3","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"チリソースじゃない陳麻婆豆腐のエビチリが最近好きで、中華の「エビチリとは？」を少し探求してみたくなりました。中華のエビマヨも探究しがいがありそうな印象。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu/status/1357522385084186624|https://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu/status/1357522385084186624\u003e","ts":"1637753731.332900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu|@chenmapo_doufu\u003e: ／\nケチャップを使わない、本場のエビチリ:fried_shrimp::chopsticks:\n＼\n\n陳麻婆豆腐のエビチリは、本場四川の伝統的なレシピそのまま。つまり、ケチャップを使いません！\n\n四川名物の泡椒(パオジャオ)という唐辛子の漬物を使って酸味を出してます！\n\n#陳麻婆豆腐 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtbiY8XUcAAXELo.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"【公式】陳麻婆豆腐🌶","author_subname":"@chenmapo_doufu","author_link":"https://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu/status/1357522385084186624","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361999954756071427/AWeTeUjf_normal.jpg","text":"／\nケチャップを使わない、本場のエビチリ:fried_shrimp::chopsticks:\n＼\n\n陳麻婆豆腐のエビチリは、本場四川の伝統的なレシピそのまま。つまり、ケチャップを使いません！\n\n四川名物の泡椒(パオジャオ)という唐辛子の漬物を使って酸味を出してます！\n\n#陳麻婆豆腐 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtbiY8XUcAAXELo.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtbiY8XUcAAXELo.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1612493532,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu/status/1357522385084186624","original_url":"https://twitter.com/chenmapo_doufu/status/1357522385084186624"},{"id":2,"text":"\u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtbiameUcAgfx6b.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EtbiameUcAgfx6b.jpg","blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"U843L486L","ts":"1637753847.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1Hs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e1824a5-38ff-4fe9-9d49-dbfd4689ba56","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"中華のエビマヨだと「ほとんどわからない」から「かなり」までの幅はあるけど、辛味は追加される感じですよね","ts":"1637753360.328000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TN7f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C685BEE5-4B88-4410-9AFA-3059DB2D524C","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"チリソースみたいになっちゃったんですね。マヨとして期待するとアレですね。。。","ts":"1637753304.327000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P+zE5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feae878f-40c7-40e8-aef9-e0596bd408db","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まあもし辛味完全になかったらそれはそれで違うんですけどね","ts":"1637753195.324900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6c="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf9cb57-adb5-478b-8a64-976b9d4c8f71","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"中華のやつです","ts":"1637753167.324100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MT5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76FE6C3F-4867-4AD6-9558-1596C5D64BA6","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"エビマヨってアボガドと一緒にサラダとして仕上げられている感じのやつですか？","ts":"1637753039.323800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dVPVI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3646496-ab4f-46e4-9aab-796cad15201e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"美味いはうまいけどいまの気分はこれじゃない、感","ts":"1637752927.322200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FHNe0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"094540c3-b720-4dc3-8c1e-88e654df728d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"エビマヨを頼んだらちょっと辛味のあるエビマヨが出てきた","ts":"1637752903.321400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDyI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56F6BF7D-4D6D-44BE-9971-DFCB4278E47A","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"今朝、半身を試したところ全く塩気が抜けきってしまっており大根が糠風味で味わいはざんねんな感じに。\nそこで、塩をしっかり追加して夜まで漬け込んだところうまく効いて、子供から「うまっ」という言葉をもらい瞬殺されました。\n\n糠床復活しました！\n\n今日はリクエストに応えて大根をもう一回漬け込み、明日は初めて :eggplant: を仕込んでみます。","ts":"1637752716.320100","thread_ts":"1637643759.297400","edited":{"user":"U843L486L","ts":"1637752765.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U02F2NDG3SQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_i